

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.15.0 (SPU pass 81): conflicts with PR312 fixed 50 ms grace, no env knob, KZ3 Bink needs over 1 s, ours kept.
Spu pass 86: the stuck-get hunk (skip the count while why == "park-wait") is gone; upstream PR #327 (patch 9327)
resets the counter on its s_park_pass flag, which 9327 also sets at this patch's park-wait break.

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.17.0 (SPU pass 95): #381's NOTIFY and FEED0001 semaphore context kept; s_sem_off now read from this patch's g_rsx_sem_off_4097.

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.18.0 (SPU pass 108): ours (GCM_PARK_WAIT_MS 30 s) + upstream f8255191's re-read of the park before a resync; upstream's `gcm_park_grace_ms()` / GCM_PARK_GRACE_MS now unused.

